# Rebuilt on demand by ui/render/*.py, never committed -- the same rule
# tools/ui_debug/generated/ follows, and for the same reason: a committed output can sit
# there looking authoritative long after it stopped matching its generator.
#
# Because this directory is ignored, `git diff` on anything inside it reports nothing however
# much changed. To show a page did not move, copy it, rebuild, and cmp against the copy.
generated/
__pycache__/
